OL,3,GNEWSAWhere to watch fireworks in East
OL,4,AYorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFireworks will spiral across the skies
OL,7,Fto celebrate Bonfire Night.
OL,9,FOfficially taking place on Thursday 5
OL,10,FNovember, a series of events are
OL,11,Fscheduled in Hull and East Yorkshire to
OL,12,Fhelp the occasion go off with a bang.
OL,14,FHumberside Fire and Rescue is
OL,15,Fencouraging people to attend organised
OL,16,Fdisplays.
OL,18,F"Attending a public display is a great
OL,19,Fway to celebrate while keeping your
OL,20,Fhousehold and neighbourhood safe," the
OL,21,Fservice said.
